# Lowered 78 -> 76 on 2026-08-03: resolveSecrets (small, fully covered) moved
# out to runner/internal/bind (then named secretref), which lands at 100%. A
# denominator change
# from a code move, not a test regression — module total rose 85.5% -> 85.6%.
# What remains uncovered here is the heartbeat/poll loop, which is exercised
# only by the connector-subprocess tests that SHIFT_COVERAGE skips.
# 74: resume checkpoint plumbing (ADR-0037) added lines that are only
# reachable by EXECUTING a flow, and every leaseloop test that executes one
# spawns a connector subprocess — which SHIFT_COVERAGE deliberately skips to
# keep the gate deterministic (ADR-0022). The wire format those lines produce
# is covered where it IS reachable, in hubclient (HeartbeatWithCheckpoint), and
# the behaviour is covered end to end in hub/internal/store.
github.com/aaron-au/shift/runner/internal/leaseloop 74
github.com/aaron-au/shift/runner/internal/bind 90
