github.com/aaron-au/shift/runner/internal/webhook 98
github.com/aaron-au/shift/sdk 83
github.com/aaron-au/shift/sdk/host 86

# The gateway is the DMZ front door (ADR-0038). Its packages are small and
# pure — a registry, a config model, an HTTP handler — with no subprocess or
# database dependency, so there is no reason for them to be thinly covered.
